  "description": "Development-only delivery sinks: email, SMS and push are captured into an in-memory inbox\n      (and optionally dropped on disk as .eml/.txt) instead of being sent, one-time codes become\n      predictable, and a SignalR hub pushes captured messages to the developer's browser live.\n      Refuses to register outside the Development environment.",
